usage: worker.py [-h] --config CONFIG --out OUT --generation GENERATION

Qualification-only multi-queue host for unchanged production Activities. Each
queue has one immutable profile. A single WarmParser is shared serially,
allowing the six fixed inputs to exercise the same child lifetime. Never
deploy this harness as the production worker package.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --out OUT
  --generation GENERATION
